<title>USA: Export inspections report delayed--USDA.</title>
<headline>Export inspections report delayed--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Monday it was delaying release of its export inspections report due to problems in assembling the data.</p>
<p>The report normally is released Mondays at 1100 EDT/1500 GMT.</p>
<p>A USDA official said she could not give a time when the report would become available but advance notice would be given.</p>
</text>
